+// validate_plan — СУХАЯ проверка плана build_montage без выполнения (файлы/эффекты/переходы).
+QString GatewayService::handleValidatePlan(const QString &requestId, const QJsonObject &params) const
+{
+    const QJsonObject plan = params.value(QStringLiteral("plan")).toObject();
+    QJsonArray issues;
+    int clipN = 0;
+    for (const QJsonValue &cv : plan.value(QStringLiteral("clips")).toArray()) {
+        const QJsonObject c = cv.toObject();
+        const QString path = c.value(QStringLiteral("clip_path")).toString();
+        if (!QFileInfo::exists(path)) {
+            issues.append(QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("clip"), clipN}, {QStringLiteral("issue"), QStringLiteral("file_not_found")}, {QStringLiteral("detail"), path}});
+        }
+        for (const QJsonValue &ev : c.value(QStringLiteral("effects")).toArray()) {
+            const QString en = ev.toObject().value(QStringLiteral("name")).toString();
+            if (!EffectsRepository::get()->exists(en)) {
+                issues.append(QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("clip"), clipN}, {QStringLiteral("issue"), QStringLiteral("effect_not_found")}, {QStringLiteral("detail"), en}});
+            }
+        }
+        ++clipN;
+    }
+    for (const QJsonValue &tv : plan.value(QStringLiteral("transitions")).toArray()) {
+        const QString tn = tv.toObject().value(QStringLiteral("transition_name")).toString();
+        if (!TransitionsRepository::get()->exists(tn)) {
+            issues.append(QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("issue"), QStringLiteral("transition_not_found")}, {QStringLiteral("detail"), tn}});
+        }
+    }
+    return GatewayProtocol::successResponse(QStringLiteral("validate_plan"), requestId, projectId(), timelineRevision(),
+        QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("valid"), issues.isEmpty()}, {QStringLiteral("clips_checked"), clipN}, {QStringLiteral("issues"), issues}});
+}
