+// query_clips — выбрать клипы по критериям (дорожка/длительность/тег/эффект/время).
+QString GatewayService::handleQueryClips(const QString &requestId, const QJsonObject &params) const
+{
+    auto tl = currentTimelineModel();
+    if (!tl) {
+        return GatewayProtocol::errorResponse(QStringLiteral("query_clips"), requestId, projectId(), timelineRevision(),
+            QStringLiteral("timeline_unavailable"), QStringLiteral("Active timeline is not available."));
+    }
+    const QJsonObject f = params.value(QStringLiteral("filter")).toObject();
+    const int fTrack = f.contains(QStringLiteral("track_id")) ? f.value(QStringLiteral("track_id")).toInt() : -1;
+    const int minF = f.contains(QStringLiteral("min_frames")) ? f.value(QStringLiteral("min_frames")).toInt() : -1;
+    const int maxF = f.contains(QStringLiteral("max_frames")) ? f.value(QStringLiteral("max_frames")).toInt() : -1;
+    const QString fTag = f.value(QStringLiteral("tag")).toString();
+    const QString fEffect = f.value(QStringLiteral("has_effect")).toString();
+    const int afterF = f.contains(QStringLiteral("after")) ? f.value(QStringLiteral("after")).toInt() : -1;
+    const int beforeF = f.contains(QStringLiteral("before")) ? f.value(QStringLiteral("before")).toInt() : -1;
+    QJsonArray matches;
+    QList<int> all = tl->getTracksIds(false);
+    all.append(tl->getTracksIds(true));
+    for (int trackId : all) {
+        if (fTrack >= 0 && trackId != fTrack) continue;
+        for (int c : tl->getItemsInRange(trackId, 0, -1, false)) {
+            if (!tl->isClip(c)) continue;
+            const int pos = tl->getClipPosition(c), dur = tl->getClipPlaytime(c);
+            if (minF >= 0 && dur < minF) continue;
+            if (maxF >= 0 && dur > maxF) continue;
+            if (afterF >= 0 && pos < afterF) continue;
+            if (beforeF >= 0 && pos > beforeF) continue;
+            if (!fTag.isEmpty()) {
+                const QJsonObject te = m_clipTags.value(QString::number(c)).toObject();
+                if (te.value(QStringLiteral("tag")).toString() != fTag) continue;
+            }
+            if (!fEffect.isEmpty()) {
+                bool has = false;
+                std::shared_ptr<EffectStackModel> stack = tl->getClipEffectStackModel(c);
+                if (stack) {
+                    for (int r = 0; r < stack->rowCount(); ++r) {
+                        std::shared_ptr<EffectItemModel> e = std::dynamic_pointer_cast<EffectItemModel>(stack->getEffectStackRow(r));
+                        if (e && e->getAssetId() == fEffect) { has = true; break; }
+                    }
+                }
+                if (!has) continue;
+            }
+            matches.append(QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("clip_id"), c}, {QStringLiteral("track_id"), trackId},
+                {QStringLiteral("position"), pos}, {QStringLiteral("duration"), dur}, {QStringLiteral("bin_id"), tl->getClipBinId(c)}});
+        }
+    }
+    return GatewayProtocol::successResponse(QStringLiteral("query_clips"), requestId, projectId(), timelineRevision(),
+        QJsonObject{{QStringLiteral("count"), matches.size()}, {QStringLiteral("clips"), matches}});
+}
